+// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+// TEMPORARY DIAGNOSTIC — T1 three-worker A/B resource and lifecycle cells.
+//
+// Installed by `T1-3worker-ab-architecture.patch` under the design packet
+// `T1-claude-3worker-ab-draft-packet.md`, and removed by restoring the
+// wrapper-owned byte-for-byte entry backup before the seat exits. These four
